<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Filmoona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Filimonas xafeez dabdabe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filmoona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Film.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Filimoonas Xaafeez Dabdaabe</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Pilmoona ammanor erintteez asii. Asay ezana Qolaasiyasa woosa keeth as maaqqada yeegii qoppiza. Pilmoonas Anasmoosa giz ayllay yeza. Yha ayllaykka fa goday karapp bette yhanigitar achch keeth yez Phawuloosar woli helleeza. Phawuloosa baggar Xoossa ammaneeza. Phawuloosa Pilmoonas Xaafeez Kiitay Pilmoona maaqqii eeko yi7ithal yez ayllayir dabotoday garkk qopisizaya. Ma gujjikka Anasmoosa Xooss ammaniza gishos yikkepp ammaniza as garkk ekkodaypp attin yikkepp aylle garkk payidippe yeegii odiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Filimoona kiitay aykkeez qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa Filimoonana galato <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa Anasimoosas shiisheez mino woosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Yesuus kiristtoosas acintteez ta Phawlossappennee nu isha Ximaatoosapp dosintteez nuur wolla oothiz Filimoonas <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>nu mishittii Afibiyasinnee nuur kiristtoosas wottadare maaqqeez Arkkiphasasinnee ne kara shiiqiza ammaniza as ubbayis <verse eid="PHM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Xoossa nu Adayppennee nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatithayinnee sarotithay yinttis maaqqo.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filmoona siiqonnee ammano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Ta woosayid ubba wode nena qopp ta Xoossa galatiza. <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Goda Yesuusal yez ne ammanannee ammaniza asayis yez ne qadha ta si7eeza. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Neenii ne ammana hara asis shagizay nuus Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggar yi7iza lo77o baz ubbay erinttod garkk taanii Xoossa woossiza. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Ta ishayyo ammanizitay wozinay ne oosayir sheemppeez gishos ne siiqayir gaame ufayssinnee minthatho ta denggeeza. <verse eid="PHM 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Yey gishshos ne oothodayis beeziza baz oothoba gi Kiristtoosa baggar yashsha bayth kiitodazin, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Ubbar yhay garkk haneez ta Phawuloosa cimay, yhattekka ma Yesuus Kiristtoosas achch maaqqeezay, siiqo bagga woossiza. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10-11"/>Kase nena maaddekka attikokka yhatti maaqqiko nenakka tanakka maaddiza gishos ta achcha yezar kiristtoosa baggar yeleez ta na7a Anasmoosa gisho woossiza. <verse eid="PHM 1:10-11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Ta eza neeko mahii dakoda, neenii ta wozinay garkk neeko dakkeezay garkk udii ekkoba. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Ta wongile gishoss accinttii yezin e ne aqo tana maaddod garkk ta eza ashshod geezin. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Zin ne lo77otithay wolqqanthor baazin dosor maaqqad garkke gi neer zorinttekkazar ashshodayis takoyekkaya. <verse eid="PHM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>E neepp shaginttii gam7eezay ubba wode neer yezod gishos maaqqada. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Yhaypp guye neer yezoday aylle garkk baazin ayllepp aadho dosintteez ishe garkke, e taas dosintteez ishe maaqqiko nees ashorannee ayyanar siiqo ishe wayizii maaqqoosa? <verse eid="PHM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Yikkee tana nees ishe udii ekkiko ezakka ta garkk udii ekkoba. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Ababazikka nena qoheez baz yezikonnee aco ezal yeziko taal oloba. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Ta Phawuloosa ta kusher e aca ciggoda gi nees xaafeeza, ne ne ubbas ta acor yezana ta qopisaamii. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Yikkee ta ishayyo yha lo77o oosa ne taas oothod garkk ta nena woossiza. Hayyana ta wozina Goday baggar shemppisoba <verse eid="PHM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Ta nees geezaypp aathii ne oothizay gishosinne azazinttiza gishos ta erii odiza. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Yeyiddakka Xoossay yi woosa si7ii tana yinttiko kammadana ta ufayttiza gishos taas shemppiza aqo giigisoytta. <verse eid="PHM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa gisho taar acintteez Ephafira sarotho shiishiza. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Taar wolla oothiza Marqqoosara Arisxirokosa Deemaasa Luqaasakka sarotha shiishiza. <verse eid="PHM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehetithay yinttar maaqqo.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
